<title>USA: CCC interest rates dip in September - USDA.</title>
<headline>CCC interest rates dip in September - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department said the interest rate for 1995 and prior crop year commodity loans disbursed by the Commodity Credit Corp in September is 5.75 percent, down from August's 5.875 percent.</p>
<p>USDA said for 1996 crop year commodity loans, the interest rate is 6.75 percent, down from 6.875 percent in August.</p>
